#: app/templates/faq.html:60
msgid "Where is the apartment located?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:62
msgid ""
"The apartment is located in the Garbatella area, one of Rome’s most "
"vibrant and authentic neighborhoods, well connected to the city center."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:67
msgid "Is public transport nearby?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:69
msgid "Yes, metro line B and several bus lines are within walking distance."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:74
msgid "How can I get there from Termini station?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:76
msgid ""
"Take Metro Line B (direction Laurentina) and get off at Garbatella or "
"Basilica San Paolo, then walk about 10 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:81
msgid "How can I get there from the airport?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:83
msgid ""
"From Fiumicino Airport, take the train to Ostiense station. From Ciampino"
" Airport, take a shuttle to Termini and then Metro Line B. Taxi and "
"private transfers are also available."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:88
msgid "Is parking available?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/faq.html:90
msgid ""
"We do not have a private parking space, but free street parking is "
"available nearby. It may require a short search, and we’ll be happy to "
"give tips."
